APPLICATIONICONNAME ID 1000 "NIO Config"
FORM ID 1000 AT (0 0 160 160) USABLE
BEGIN
 TITLE "NIO Config"
 PUSHBUTTON "Hosts" ID 9001 AT (2 16 50 12) USABLE GROUP 9
 PUSHBUTTON "Info" ID 9002 AT (54 16 50 12) USABLE GROUP 9
 PUSHBUTTON "Setup" ID 9003 AT (106 16 52 12) USABLE GROUP 9
 PUSHBUTTON "Springboard" ID 1001 AT (4 35 54 14) USABLE GROUP 1
 PUSHBUTTON "USB" ID 1007 AT (60 35 22 14) USABLE GROUP 1
 PUSHBUTTON "Serial" ID 1002 AT (84 35 30 14) USABLE GROUP 1
 PUSHBUTTON "Network" ID 1009 AT (116 35 40 14) USABLE GROUP 1
 LABEL "Baud:" ID 1011 AT (4 60) NONUSABLE
 POPUPTRIGGER "115200" ID 1003 AT (46 57 108 14) NONUSABLE LEFTANCHOR
 LABEL "Flow:" ID 1012 AT (4 83) NONUSABLE
 POPUPTRIGGER "None" ID 1004 AT (46 80 108 14) NONUSABLE LEFTANCHOR
 LIST "9600" "19200" "38400" "57600" "115200" ID 1013 AT (46 57 108 AUTO) NONUSABLE VISIBLEITEMS 5
 LIST "None" "RTS/CTS" ID 1014 AT (46 80 108 AUTO) NONUSABLE VISIBLEITEMS 2
 POPUPLIST ID 1003 1013
 POPUPLIST ID 1004 1014
 BUTTON "WiFi" ID 1008 AT (2 145 36 13) USABLE FRAME
 BUTTON "Save" ID 1005 AT (42 145 34 13) USABLE FRAME
 BUTTON "Test" ID 1006 AT (80 145 32 13) USABLE FRAME
 BUTTON "Reset" ID 1010 AT (116 145 42 13) USABLE FRAME
END

