 LIST "" ID 1201 AT (2 47 145 88) VISIBLEITEMS 8 USABLE
 SCROLLBAR ID 1209 AT (151 47 7 88) VALUE 0 MIN 0 MAX 0 PAGESIZE 1 USABLE
 BUTTON "<" ID 1205 AT (2 145 16 13) USABLE FRAME
 BUTTON ">" ID 1206 AT (20 145 16 13) USABLE FRAME
